            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An arm? (ذراع, dhirāʿ.) The body? (جسم, jism.) An ankle? (كاحل, kāḥil.) The throat? (حلق, ḥalq.) A headache? (صداع, ṣudāʿ.) A mood? (مزاج, mizāj.) An exercise? (تمرين, tamrīn.) Fitness? (لياقة, liyāqa.) An injury? (إصابة, iṣāba.) A pill? (حبة, ḥabba.) Early? (مبكرا, mubakkiran.) Daily? (يوميا, yawmiyyan.) A delay? (تأخير, taʾkhīr.) Late? (متأخرا, mutaʾakhkhiran.) Never? (أبدا, abadan.) The future? (مستقبل, mustaqbal.) A period? (مدة, mudda.) A beginning? (بداية, bidāya.) Rarely? (نادرا, nādiran.) Often? (كثيرا, kathīran.)"
